or-lahore-visit/articleshow/135806818.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mea-reminds-indias-stance-against-pakistan-as-punjab-cm-seeks-clearance-for-lahore-visit/articleshow/135806818.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T19:57:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135806849,imgsize-89034.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Air India, Air India Express suspend flights to Riyadh, Dammam till Nov 30; Jeddah till Nov 21 amid threat]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/air-india-air-india-express-suspend-flights-to-riyadh-dammam-till-nov-30-jeddah-till-nov-21-amid-threat/articleshow/135805478.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135805478.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Air India and Air India Express have announced an extension of their flight suspensions to Riyadh and Dammam until November 30, with Jeddah flights suspended until November 21. This decision, impacting also IndiGo and Akasa Air, arises from the increased instability in the region due to threats from Yemen's Houthi militia. Affected passengers may reschedule or obtain refunds for their bookings.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/air-india-air-india-express-suspend-flights-to-riyadh-dammam-till-nov-30-jeddah-till-nov-21-amid-threat/articleshow/135805478.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/air-india-air-india-express-suspend-flights-to-riyadh-dammam-till-nov-30-jeddah-till-nov-21-amid-threat/articleshow/135805478.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T19:27:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135805970,imgsize-38252.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['How EC gave him info is a mystery': Akhilesh on Yogi's 1.27 crore Hindu voters deleted claim]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/how-ec-gave-him-info-is-a-mystery-akhilesh-on-yogis-1-27-crore-hindu-voters-deleted-claim/articleshow/135804650.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135804650.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Akhilesh Yadav has voiced significant alarm over Yogi Adityanath's assertion that 1.27 crore Hindu voters were removed from the electoral rolls. He questions the legitimacy of how Adityanath accessed this information from the Election Commission. Yadav suggests that this statement aims to incite fear among voters and indicates some underlying conspiracy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/how-ec-gave-him-info-is-a-mystery-akhilesh-on-yogis-1-27-crore-hindu-voters-deleted-claim/articleshow/135804650.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/how-ec-gave-him-info-is-a-mystery-akhilesh-on-yogis-1-27-crore-hindu-voters-deleted-claim/articleshow/135804650.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T19:01:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135805324,imgsize-97826.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Evening news wrap: Microsoft struggles to restore services after 16-hour outage; 23 killed in Kaziranga crash &amp; more]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-microsoft-struggles-to-restore-services-after-16-hour-outage-23-killed-in-kaziranga-crash-more/articleshow/135804525.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135804525.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CD